729
01:17:36.662 --> 01:17:39.295
Let's go upstairs. come.

730
01:17:40.028 --> 01:17:42.495
Do you like the place?

731
01:17:43.962 --> 01:17:44.995
Follow me.

732
01:17:48.628 --> 01:17:53.661
