768
01:20:55.695 --> 01:20:57.762
Smile. jerk. come on!

769
01:21:00.462 --> 01:21:01.462
Smile!

770
01:21:04.828 --> 01:21:05.995
That looks good.

771
01:21:07.295 --> 01:21:09.495
