One. two. three!

796
01:24:19.062 --> 01:24:22.062
You punk.

797
01:24:22.428 --> 01:24:24.795
Don't run around naked.
put this on.

798
01:24:54.262 --> 01:24:57.362
These punks...

799
01:25:11.428 --> 01:25:12.662
Are you

800
01:25:15.362 --> 01:25:19.228
