816
01:26:41.995 --> 01:26:44.861
Damn it. answer me!

817
01:26:44.928 --> 01:26:48.361
Answer me if you do. jerk!

818
01:26:48.428 --> 01:26:50.395
Yeah. yeah. yeah. I hear you

819
01:26:50.462 --> 01:26:51.795
